{
  "key": 40223,
  "messages": [
    {
      "id": "DWLostTower_Text_FollowTheSeam",
      "en_US": [
        "...Follow the seam.\r",
        "Not that one.\n",
        "That one is a scar."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "DWLostTower_Text_VioletCrystals",
      "en_US": [
        "Violet crystals grow out of the\n",
        "rock. Eclipse Shards.\r",
        "A whole vein of them."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "DWLostTower_Text_WallOfShadow",
      "en_US": [
        "A wall of shadow. It won't move.\r",
        "There's no sign of Cyrus."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "DWLostTower_Text_CyrusYouCame",
      "en_US": [
        "Cyrus: ...You came."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "DWLostTower_Text_CyrusHundredVoices",
      "en_US": [
        "Cyrus: It's been alone down here\n",
        "with a hundred voices.\r",
        "I know how that is."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "DWLostTower_Text_GotCalmShard",
      "en_US": [
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0} got a Calm Shard!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "DWLostTower_Text_ResonatorSilent",
      "en_US": [
        "The Resonator stays silent."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "DWLostTower_Text_HitmonleeKicked",
      "en_US": [
        "Hitmonlee's ghost kicked the scar\n",
        "shut!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "DWLostTower_Text_ScarHolds",
      "en_US": [
        "The scar groans under you...\n",
        "but it holds."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "DWLostTower_Text_VespiquenLit",
      "en_US": [
        "Vespiquen's ghost lit the true\n",
        "seam!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "DWLostTower_Text_SeamAlone",
      "en_US": [
        "You'll have to find the true\n",
        "seam alone."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "DWLostTower_Text_StonesSunk",
      "en_US": [
        "Stepping stones lie sunk in the\n",
        "mist below. Too deep to reach."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "DWLostTower_Text_LaprasSang",
      "en_US": [
        "Lapras's ghost sang, and the\n",
        "stones rose out of the mist!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "DWLostTower_Text_StonesDrift",
      "en_US": [
        "...The stones drift up out of\n",
        "the mist on their own."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "DWLostTower_Text_GapTooWide",
      "en_US": [
        "There's a gap, far too wide to\n",
        "jump. Cyrus is on the far side!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "DWLostTower_Text_SkarmoryCarried",
      "en_US": [
        "Skarmory's ghost carried you\n",
        "across the gap!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "DWLostTower_Text_YouLeap",
      "en_US": [
        "...There's no other way.\n",
        "You take a running leap!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "DWLostTower_Text_Litwick",
      "en_US": [
        "A Litwick. Its candle flame burns\n",
        "pale and cold beside the seam."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "DWLostTower_Text_CyrusProof",
      "en_US": [
        "Cyrus: I came looking for proof.\r",
        "All I found was this one.\r",
        "...And you."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "DWLostTower_Text_PadPromptHitmonlee",
      "en_US": [
        "Hitmonlee's strength still\n",
        "hums in the Resonator.\n",
        "Call on it?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "DWLostTower_Text_PadPromptVespiquen",
      "en_US": [
        "Vespiquen's light still glows\n",
        "in the Resonator.\n",
        "Call on it?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "DWLostTower_Text_PadPromptLapras",
      "en_US": [
        "Lapras's song still echoes\n",
        "in the Resonator.\n",
        "Call on it?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "DWLostTower_Text_PadPromptSkarmory",
      "en_US": [
        "Skarmory's wings still beat\n",
        "in the Resonator.\n",
        "Call on it?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "DWLostTower_Text_PadDenied",
      "en_US": [
        "That totem has not been\n",
        "calmed yet."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "DWLostTower_Text_PadEffectHitmonlee",
      "en_US": [
        "Hitmonlee's ghost smashed\n",
        "the crystal!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "DWLostTower_Text_PadEffectVespiquen",
      "en_US": [
        "Vespiquen's ghost lit the\n",
        "dark tiles!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "DWLostTower_Text_HintWall",
      "en_US": [
        "Ruth's voice: The low seam\n",
        "is a scar. Climb, and\n",
        "follow the light."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "DWLostTower_Text_HintDeeper",
      "en_US": [
        "Ruth's voice: The shadow walks\n",
        "the stones. Step aside and\n",
        "let it pass, then cross."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "DWLostTower_Text_HintRune",
      "en_US": [
        "Ruth's voice: The rune takes you\n",
        "up to Vespiquen's pad. Light\n",
        "the dark tiles, then come down."
      ]
    }
  ]
}
